  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a45b5b9191c13cd4da310eb8df100becb078c240f4b0e763420ec154fb42a5fd.png] \n\nDecoding the given information :\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n Means\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\n \n\nNow check each option:\n\nOption 1) 18 C 5 A 42 D 6 B 17\n\n18 + 5 ÷ 42 - 6 × 17\n\n→ 18 + __**5 ÷ 42**__ - 6 × 17\n\n→ 18 + 0.199 - __**6 × 17**__\n\n→ 18 + 0.199 - 102\n\n→ -83.881 ≠ 80\n\nOption 2) 18 A 5 B 42 C 6 D 17\n\n18 ÷ 5 × 42 + 6 - 17\n\n→ __18 ÷ 5__ × 42 + 6 - 17\n\n→ __3.6 × 42__ + 6 - 17\n\n→ 151.2 + 6 - 17\n\n→ 140.2 ≠ 80\n\n**Option 3) 18 B 5 C 42 A 6 D 17**\n\n18 × 5 + 42 ÷ 6 - 17 \n\n→18 × 5 + __**42 ÷ 6**__ - 17 \n\n→__**18 × 5**__ + 7 - 17 \n\n→ 90 + 7 -17\n\n**→ 80 **\n\nOption 4) 18 D 5 A 42 B 6 C 17\n\n18 - 5 ÷ 42 × 6 + 17\n\n→ 18 - __5 ÷ 42__ × 6 + 17\n\n→ 18 - __0.119 × 6__ + 17\n\n→ 18 - 0.714 + 17\n\n→ 34.286 ≠ 80.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
